                "text": "For more than 25 hours, Democrats fought to stop Republicans from ripping Medicaid away from millions of Americans.\n\nIs it fair to say my colleagues across the aisle couldn\u2019t care less about protecting their constituents' healthcare?\n\nLet\u2019s ask the Republican representative of New York\u2019s 23rd district.",
