                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicaid and Medicare have saved lives every single day over their 60 years serving Americans. So many families owe so very much to these programs \u2013 and yet, Republicans didn\u2019t even blink when Trump demanded they pass the biggest healthcare cuts in the history of this country.\n\nDemocrats will never stop fighting to reverse their cruelty and protect the care working people rely on.",
