                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On this Labor Day, I'm proud to stand with the hardworking people of NY-09 and across this nation \u2013 from healthcare workers, educators, transit operators, small business employees, and union members who keep America moving forward.\n\nToday, we celebrate generations of hard-working people \u2013 who organized, sacrificed, and spoke out against injustices on the job.\n\nIn Central Brooklyn, we know that our communities are stronger when our laborers are protected. I remain committed to fighting for fair wages, equitable and safe working conditions, and the right to organize.\n\nTo all the workers of NY-09 and throughout America: we see you, we thank you, and we've got your back.",
