                "text": "Republicans refuse to defend our federal workers. They refuse to protect Americans\u2019 healthcare. They refuse to do their jobs.\n\nBut House Democrats always will.\n\nTune into our 24 hour livestream at 6:30 AM to see me break down how we\u2019re fighting back against the Trump Shutdown.",
