                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans can hide from their problems all they'd like\u00a0\u2013 running away won't end this shutdown, it won't keep Americans' healthcare costs from skyrocketing, and it certainly won't stop the Epstein Discharge Petition from passing through the People's House the moment it reopens.",
