                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A promise is only as good as the people who give it.\n\u00a0\nSo how much is a promise from the party that sued to rip food from the mouths of starving Americans and shut down the government because they wanted healthcare to be even more unaffordable really worth? \n\u00a0\nNothing at all.\n\u00a0\nThe Senate\u2019s deal doesn\u2019t just provide no legitimate path towards extending ACA tax credits, but it essentially rewards Trump and his Republicans for the campaign of cruelty they\u2019ve proudly inflicted upon the American people.\n\u00a0\nI will vote NO when it reaches the House, and I urge each of my colleagues to do the same.",
